<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="LiM-iMa stands for Limitless Imagination—a personal journal for sharing and keeping everyday thoughts." />
    <title>LiM-iMa — About</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" />
    <script src="./app.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page-shell">
      <header class="topbar">
        <a class="brand-wrap" href="./" aria-label="LiM-iMa home">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">L</span>
          <span class="brand-copy">
            <span class="eyebrow">A personal journal</span>
            <span class="brand-name">LiM-iMa</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="./">Home</a>
          <a href="./profile.html">Profile</a>
          <a href="./about.html" aria-current="page">About</a>
        </nav>
        <button id="themeToggle" class="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Dark mode</button>
      </header>

      <main class="inner-page about-page">
        <section class="about-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">A note about this space</p>
          <h1>Small thoughts.<br /><em>Room to grow.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-description">LiM-iMa stands for <em>Limitless Imagination</em>—a space to stay curious, share ideas, and give every thought room to grow.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-grid">
          <article class="about-card">
            <span class="about-number">01</span>
            <h2>Why a journal?</h2>
            <p>Writing helps turn passing moments into something we can revisit. This is a home for those notes, whether they’re thoughtful, curious, or just a little bit random.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="about-card">
            <span class="about-number">02</span>
            <h2>Open to everyone</h2>
            <p>Anyone can share a post or comment on a thought here, with no account or login required. Read, write, and join the conversation.</p>
          </article>
        </section>

        <section class="about-note">
          <span class="note-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
          <p>Take what resonates, leave with a thought of your own.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="./">Explore the journal <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer class="site-footer">
        <a class="footer-brand" href="./">LiM-iMa</a>
        <span>Made for the thoughts worth keeping.</span>
        <a href="./profile.html">Meet the writer</a>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
